Test Statistic

T_0 =
\begin{cases}
  R_+ = \text{sum of positive ranks} & \text{if left-tailed} \\
  R_- = \text{sum of negative ranks} & \text{if right-tailed} \\
  \min(R_+, R_-) & \text{if two-tailed}
\end{cases}

Probability Ground Rules

Every probability is between 0 and 1. 0 \le P(A) \le 1 where P(A) =
\begin{cases}
0, & \text{A is impossible} \\
1, & \text{A is guaranteed}
\end{cases}
All possible outcomes, added together, equal 1.

The full sample space accounts for 100% of the possibilities.
